        "rationale": "The agent correctly pulled history for the right asset/site/window and the latest reading, computed a health index, and applied the decision logic honestly (no work order created, retest recommended, disagreeing signal named). However, it failed the core forecasting requirement: both channels had >=4 usable samples, so the task required a model forecast with 80% prediction intervals via tsfm.find_models + tsfm.run_recipe (after materializing the series / checking quality with tsfm.data_quality).",
        "details": {
